# MI directed probes, pass/fail on W2 and W4 (tohost 1 for the specified
# behaviour): the fixes found by the ACT4 bump, CSR WARL fields and aliases
# (mi_csr_warl), the uimm5 of the vector .vi shifts (mi_vshift_vi) and the
# VLMAX bound of vrgather and vslidedown at a fractional LMUL (mi_vperm_frac),
# the VS-stage A/D update under henvcfg.ADUE (mi_vs_adue), and the RVA23.1
# options: PTE bits 60:59 at every stage (mi_svrsw), double traps
# (mi_dbltrp), and the indirect CSRs, counter delegation and srmcfg
# (mi_csrind).
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
miprobe/mi_csr_warl budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mi_csr_warl.hex lockstep=0
miprobe/mi_vshift_vi budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mi_vshift_vi.hex lockstep=0
miprobe/mi_vperm_frac budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mi_vperm_frac.hex lockstep=0
miprobe/mi_vs_adue budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mi_vs_adue.hex lockstep=0
miprobe/mi_svrsw budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mi_svrsw.hex lockstep=0
miprobe/mi_dbltrp budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mi_dbltrp.hex lockstep=0
miprobe/mi_csrind budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mi_csrind.hex lockstep=0
